# Read Memory Latest — Canonical Read Prompt

> **Prompt Version:** 2.2.0  
> **Invocation:** `@[01-prompts/03-read-write/03-read-memory-latest.md]` or `@[.agents/skills/read-memory-latest/skill.md]`

## Purpose
Ingest project identity, architectural guidelines, recent git commit history, and active plans from `.ai-memory/` to initialize or restore session context.

## Directives
1. Inspect `.ai-memory/what-to-read.md` and root `readme.md`.
2. Review recent commits via `gitmap log -n 10` or `git log -n 10 --oneline`.
3. Load active plans from `.ai-memory/plans/pending/`.
4. Enforce coding guidelines and error management invariants.
